{#
tasks/_editor.html.twig — creating or editing a task, in the app's modal frame.

Never rendered inside the pane; _event_modal.html.twig says why. Hand-written
rather than a FormType for its reason too: a few fields read straight off the
request with a CSRF check, and a date and time pair that TaskWriter turns into one
of two columns.

Start date and priority have no field in the first version. They are not posted,
so TaskDraft cannot carry them and an edit leaves them as they are.

A step is worked on here too, and is not a task of its own in the pane. Ticking one
is not a submit at all, so nothing here moves: see tasks--step-tick. A saved step's
title is a field of the editor's form and is saved with it; one emptied keeps the
title it had, since the × beside it is how a step goes. A new step is a field too,
saved done if its own tick says so, and its × only takes the field away.

**One form, whatever is pressed.** A delete is a submit button of the editor's form
with a `formaction` of its own, not a form of its own, and stays in the dialog
(data-ui--modal-keep-open on the button). So they post everything typed
so far, and the answer puts it back: separate forms answered with the dialog as
stored, which threw away a changed title and any step being typed. The form itself is empty of anything visible, and every field names it
with `form=`, because the order puts these buttons in among the fields.

Accepts:
  task        Task, or null for a new one
  list        TaskList it is on, or lands on
  query       TaskPaneQuery, where the pane goes back to
  error       string|null, said at the top after a refused save
  zone        DateTimeZone the due time is written and read in
  paneUrl     string|null, set after a step or a file changed
  posted      array, what the form sent when the dialog is its answer, to put back
#}
{% import '_partials/_select.html.twig' as select %}
{% set params = query.toParameters() %}
{% set posted = posted|default({}) %}
{% set field = 'w-full rounded-lg border border-line bg-field px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-faint' %}
{% set label = 'block mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink' %}
{% set sectionHeading = 'text-sm font-medium text-ink' %}
{% set readOnly = list.isReadOnly %}
{# A step repeats with its task, and an entry is one occurrence already done, so
   neither has a repeat, steps or files of its own. #}
{% set isWhole = task is null or not (task.isStep or task.isOccurrence) %}

<turbo-frame id="modal">
    <template data-ui--modal-frame-title>{{ (task ? 'tasks.editor.edit' : 'tasks.editor.new')|trans }}</template>

    {# A step or a file just changed: the pane underneath is told, since it is a
       different frame. Runs as it lands, as the pane's toasts do. #}
    {% if paneUrl|default(null) %}
        <turbo-stream action="open_pane" pane="tasks" src="{{ paneUrl }}"></turbo-stream>
    {% endif %}

    <form id="task-editor" action="{{ path('app_tasks_save') }}" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-turbo-frame="modal">
        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('tasks_editor') }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="taskId" value="{{ task ? task.id : 0 }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="listId" value="{{ list.id }}">
        {% for name, value in params %}
            <input type="hidden" name="{{ name }}" value="{{ value }}">
        {% endfor %}

        {# First, because Enter in a field presses the form's first submit button in
           document order, and every other one here does something else: it was the
           footer's Delete, so Enter in the title deleted the task. #}
        <button type="submit" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></button>
    </form>

    <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto px-6 pb-4 space-y-4 max-md:px-4">
        {% if error %}
            <div role="alert" class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg alert-danger px-3.5 py-3 text-sm text-danger">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <p>{{ error }}</p>
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if readOnly %}
            <p class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg bg-sunken px-3.5 py-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-lock mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                {{ 'tasks.read_only'|trans }}
            </p>
        {% endif %}

        <div data-editor-part="title">
            <label class="{{ label }}" for="task-title">{{ 'tasks.editor.title'|trans }}</label>
            <input id="task-title" type="text" name="title" form="task-editor" required autofocus
                   maxlength="{{ constant('App\\Entity\\Task\\Task::TITLE_MAX_LENGTH') }}"
                   value="{{ posted.title ?? (task ? task.title : '') }}"
                   {% if readOnly %}disabled{% endif %}
                   class="{{ field }}">
        </div>

        {% if isWhole %}
            <section data-editor-part="steps" aria-labelledby="task-steps-heading" class="space-y-2"
                     {% if not readOnly %}data-controller="tasks--new-steps"{% endif %}>
                <h3 id="task-steps-heading" class="{{ sectionHeading }}">{{ 'tasks.editor.steps'|trans }}</h3>

                {% if task %}
                    <ul class="space-y-1">
                            {% for step in task.liveSteps %}
                                <li class="flex items-center gap-2" data-task-step="{{ step.id }}">
                                    {% include 'tasks/_step_tick.html.twig' with { step: step, readOnly: readOnly, offset: '' } only %}
                                    <input type="text" name="stepTitles[{{ step.id }}]" form="task-editor" autocomplete="off"
                                           value="{{ posted.stepTitles[step.id] ?? step.title }}"
                                           maxlength="{{ constant('App\\Entity\\Task\\Task::TITLE_MAX_LENGTH') }}"
                                           aria-label="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_title'|trans }}"
                                           {% if readOnly %}disabled{% endif %}
                                           class="{{ field }} peer-aria-checked:text-ink-faint peer-aria-checked:line-through">
                                    {% if not readOnly %}
                                        <button type="submit"
                                            form="task-editor"
                                            formaction="{{ path('app_tasks_step_delete', { id: step.id }) }}"
                                            formnovalidate
                                            data-ui--modal-keep-open
                                            aria-label="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_delete'|trans({ '%title%': step.title }) }}"
                                            title="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_delete'|trans({ '%title%': step.title }) }}"
                                            class="w-6 h-6 shrink-0 rounded text-ink-faint hover:text-danger hover:bg-hover cursor-pointer">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                    </button>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                {% endif %}

                {% if not readOnly %}
                    <template data-tasks--new-steps-target="template">
                        {{ _self.stepField('', field) }}
                    </template>

                    {# One more than was typed, with or without the script: a page
                       before it connects, and one where it never does, can still
                       take the one step. Empty ones are not steps. #}
                    <ul class="space-y-1.5" data-tasks--new-steps-target="list">
                        {% for index, title in posted.steps ?? [] %}
                            {% if title|trim is not empty %}{{ _self.stepField(title, field, '1' == (posted.stepsDone[index] ?? '0')) }}{% endif %}
                        {% endfor %}
                        {{ _self.stepField('', field) }}
                    </ul>
                {% endif %}
            </section>
        {% endif %}

        <div data-editor-part="reminder">
            <label class="{{ label }}" for="task-reminder">{{ 'tasks.editor.reminder'|trans }}</label>
            <input id="task-reminder" type="datetime-local" name="reminder" form="task-editor"
                   value="{{ posted.reminder ?? (task and task.reminderAt ? task.reminderAt|date('Y-m-d\\TH:i', zone) : '') }}"
                   {% if readOnly %}disabled{% endif %}
                   class="{{ field }}">
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">{{ 'tasks.editor.reminder_hint'|trans }}</p>
        </div>

        {# Printed in the reader's zone and read back in it, so a time saved
           unchanged is the same instant. A date has no zone to convert. #}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3" data-editor-part="due">
            <div>
                <label class="{{ label }}" for="task-due-date">{{ 'tasks.editor.due_date'|trans }}</label>
                <input id="task-due-date" type="date" name="dueDate" form="task-editor"
                       value="{{ posted.dueDate ?? (task and task.dueDate ? task.dueDate|date('Y-m-d', false) : (task and task.dueAt ? task.dueAt|date('Y-m-d', zone) : '')) }}"
                       {% if readOnly %}disabled{% endif %}
                       class="{{ field }}">
            </div>
            <div>
                <label class="{{ label }}" for="task-due-time">{{ 'tasks.editor.due_time'|trans }}</label>
                <input id="task-due-time" type="time" name="dueTime" form="task-editor"
                       value="{{ posted.dueTime ?? (task and task.dueAt ? task.dueAt|date('H:i', zone) : '') }}"
                       {% if readOnly or not list.keepsDueTime %}disabled{% endif %}
                       {% if not list.keepsDueTime %}aria-describedby="task-due-day-only"{% endif %}
                       class="{{ field }}">
            </div>
            {# Offered and then lost at the next sync would be worse than not offered. #}
            {% if not list.keepsDueTime %}
                <p id="task-due-day-only" class="col-span-2 -mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">{{ 'tasks.editor.due_day_only'|trans }}</p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% if isWhole %}
            {% set choice = posted.recurrence ?? (task ? task.recurrenceChoice : '') %}
            <div data-editor-part="repeat">
                <label class="{{ label }}" for="task-recurrence">{{ 'tasks.editor.repeat'|trans }}</label>
                <select id="task-recurrence" name="recurrence" form="task-editor" {% if readOnly %}disabled{% endif %}
                        {{ select.enhance() }}
                        class="select-field w-full h-9 text-sm">
                    <option value="">{{ 'tasks.editor.repeat_none'|trans }}</option>
                    {% for option in constant('App\\Entity\\Task\\Task::RECURRENCE_RULES')|keys %}
                        <option value="{{ option }}" {% if choice == option %}selected{% endif %}>{{ ('tasks.editor.repeat_' ~ option)|trans }}</option>
                    {% endfor %}
                    {% if 'keep' == choice %}
                        <option value="keep" selected>{{ 'tasks.editor.repeat_keep'|trans }}</option>
                    {% endif %}
                </select>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">{{ 'tasks.editor.repeat_hint'|trans }}</p>
            </div>

            {# A chosen file goes up with Save, the same for a task new or saved. Not
               offered on a public demo, whose disk nothing reaps: see DemoMode. #}
            {% set canAttach = not readOnly and not demo.isEnabled %}
            <div data-editor-part="files">
                {% if canAttach or (task and task.attachments is not empty) %}
                    <section aria-labelledby="task-files-heading" class="space-y-2">
                        <h3 id="task-files-heading" class="{{ sectionHeading }}">{{ 'tasks.attachments.heading'|trans }}</h3>

                        {% if task and task.attachments is not empty %}
                            <ul class="space-y-1">
                                {% for attachment in task.attachments %}
                                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm" data-task-attachment="{{ attachment.id }}">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-paperclip text-ink-faint shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        {# A foreign link leaves through the browser, with no referrer.
                                           It is http or https, or the converter never stored it. #}
                                        {% if attachment.isStoredHere %}
                                            <a href="{{ path('app_tasks_attachment_download', { id: attachment.id }) }}"
                                               data-turbo="false"
                                               class="flex-1 min-w-0 truncate text-accent underline">{{ attachment.filename }}</a>
                                        {% else %}
                                            <a href="{{ attachment.externalUrl }}"
                                               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                               class="flex-1 min-w-0 truncate text-accent underline">{{ attachment.filename }}</a>
                                        {% endif %}
                                        {% if not readOnly and attachment.isStoredHere %}
                                            <button type="submit"
                                                form="task-editor"
                                                formaction="{{ path('app_tasks_attachment_delete', { id: attachment.id }) }}"
                                                formnovalidate
                                                data-ui--modal-keep-open
                                                aria-label="{{ 'tasks.attachments.delete'|trans({ '%name%': attachment.filename }) }}"
                                                title="{{ 'tasks.attachments.delete'|trans({ '%name%': attachment.filename }) }}"
                                                class="w-6 h-6 shrink-0 rounded text-ink-faint hover:text-danger hover:bg-hover cursor-pointer">
                                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                        </button>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                        {% endif %}

                        {% if canAttach %}
                            <label class="sr-only" for="task-new-file">{{ 'tasks.attachments.add'|trans }}</label>
                            <input id="task-new-file" type="file" name="file" form="task-editor" class="w-full min-w-0 text-sm text-ink-muted">
                            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">{{ 'tasks.attachments.limit'|trans }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                    </section>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div data-editor-part="notes">
            <label class="{{ label }}" for="task-notes">{{ 'tasks.editor.notes'|trans }}</label>
            <textarea id="task-notes" name="notes" form="task-editor" rows="4"
                      {% if readOnly %}disabled{% endif %}
                      class="{{ field }}">{{ posted.notes ?? (task ? task.notes : '') }}</textarea>
            {% if task and task.notes %}
                {# The links, which a textarea cannot make clickable. #}
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">{{ task.notes|linkify }}</p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer class="shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line px-6 py-3 max-md:px-4">
        {% if task and not readOnly %}
            <button type="submit"
                    form="task-editor"
                    formaction="{{ path('app_tasks_delete', { id: task.id }) }}"
                    formnovalidate
                    class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm text-danger hover:bg-hover transition-colors">
                {{ 'tasks.editor.delete'|trans }}
            </button>
        {% endif %}
        <button type="button"
                data-action="ui--modal#close"
                class="ml-auto px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover transition-colors">
            {{ 'form.cancel'|trans }}
        </button>
        {% if not readOnly %}
            <button type="submit"
                    form="task-editor"
                    class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm bg-accent text-accent-ink hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
                {{ 'tasks.editor.save'|trans }}
            </button>
        {% endif %}
    </footer>
</turbo-frame>


{# A field a step is typed into. See tasks--new-steps. #}
{% macro stepField(title, field, done = false) %}
    <li class="flex items-center gap-2" data-task-new-step>
        <input type="hidden" name="stepsDone[]" form="task-editor" value="{{ done ? '1' : '0' }}">
        <button type="button"
                role="checkbox"
                aria-checked="{{ done ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
                aria-label="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_done'|trans }}"
                title="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_done'|trans }}"
                data-action="tasks--new-steps#tick"
                {% if title|trim is empty %}disabled{% endif %}
                class="peer group/tick flex items-center justify-center size-4 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-ink-faint transition-colors cursor-pointer hover:border-accent
                       disabled:cursor-default disabled:hover:border-ink-faint
                       aria-checked:border-accent aria-checked:bg-accent aria-checked:text-accent-ink">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-check text-[0.5rem] invisible group-aria-checked/tick:visible" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <input type="text" name="steps[]" form="task-editor" autocomplete="off"
               value="{{ title }}"
               maxlength="{{ constant('App\\Entity\\Task\\Task::TITLE_MAX_LENGTH') }}"
               aria-label="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_add'|trans }}"
               placeholder="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_add'|trans }}"
               data-tasks--new-steps-target="field"
               data-action="input->tasks--new-steps#typed keydown.enter->tasks--new-steps#next blur->tasks--new-steps#left"
               class="{{ field }} peer-aria-checked:text-ink-faint peer-aria-checked:line-through">
        {# Kept in its place while there is nothing to take away, so the column does not shift. #}
        <button type="button"
                data-step-remove
                data-action="tasks--new-steps#remove"
                aria-label="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_remove'|trans }}"
                title="{{ 'tasks.editor.step_remove'|trans }}"
                {% if title|trim is empty %}disabled{% endif %}
                class="w-6 h-6 shrink-0 rounded text-ink-faint hover:text-danger hover:bg-hover cursor-pointer disabled:invisible">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
    </li>
{% endmacro %}
